        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "=Hi {{ $('Validate & Clean Data').first().json.first_name }},\n\nJust checking in on the message you sent us a couple of days ago. Would a short, no-obligation call this week help? You can pick a time that suits you here: YOUR_BOOKING_LINK\n\nIf now isn't the right moment, no worries at all — just reply whenever you're ready.\n\nWarm regards,\nThe Larkfield Interiors team",
        "options": {
